  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#2dc26b\"><em><strong>Стемпанк Небо</strong></em></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>Steampunk Sky — это креативная карта, созданная с нуля.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>Она основана на теме стипленпук с плавающими структурами и островами.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span>Все зоны декорированы, и большинство из них пригодны для развития персонажа.</span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\">Карта</span></strong></em></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a5d2b99b-5b0a-4228-872a-51ff883441c4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></em></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b316ce05-43cf-4a91-a2d2-bc6b759e1cd1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_bcee8853-bcbd-4d01-8f44-3868363ccf40.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_479e73a3-01cc-4828-b6a0-b2da517d6e44.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_30cea19d-1d8a-4d3a-b8fe-9b83506c0e29.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_884bf1a9-af9b-45a5-a67a-46e858dbb5d7.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_63c79b12-156d-4b87-99fe-5c180d1a10b1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a89127fa-5263-44b5-86fc-b1620a9c80e1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_e55989f8-c45d-4997-824e-8cbd86d3b7eb.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_1b48b03f-b916-47ad-b3b1-c44ce40d8ed5.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_54064b04-4141-40f9-b3dd-d67ece614f6b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_62825218-539a-4a5a-9032-b07a464ae8e4.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_91451d80-24d4-4761-aa3c-b8c6dbdac043.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_dfa1dcc7-8f5d-43b6-8185-697accb9e051.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
